This derived address database is made available under the Open Database License
1.0 (ODbL-1.0). Retain attribution and comply with the licence's applicable
share-alike requirements when using or distributing derived databases. The
project's PolyForm Shield source-code licence does not replace this data licence.
Geofabrik provided the extracts; the manifest records public source URLs, source
hashes, replication timestamps and selected OSM node IDs/versions.

Country clipping uses Natural Earth 1:10m countries, public domain:
  https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/
  https://github.com/nvkelso/natural-earth-vector
  commit ca96624a56bd078437bca8184e78163e5039ad19

English country labels come from GeoNames countryInfo.txt, CC BY 4.0:
  https://www.geonames.org/
  https://download.geonames.org/export/dump/countryInfo.txt
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

This is mapped-source consistency evidence, not independent national accuracy,
mail deliverability, survey-grade coordinates or endorsement by these providers.
